      "name": "Thaumaturgy \u2014 1 Basic \u2014 Eyes of the Earth",
      "type": "power",
      "img": "icons/magic/nature/root-vines-green.webp",
      "system": {
        "description": "<p>The vampire \"sees\" everything that transpires within 10 miles of her attuned haven or shrine by utilizing the spirits of the grass, trees, rocks, and animals in the vicinity. No sound accompanies the visions, and unless the practitioner can read lips she cannot know what is being said. If she wishes to track a particular person for more than one night, she must relocate him again after each broken contact.</p><p><strong>System:</strong> The vampire ingests an infusion of her own vitae mixed with soil, grass shoots, leaves, animal fur, and bird feathers. The number of successes on a Willpower roll determines the duration: 1 success grants one turn, 2 one hour, 3 one night, 4 one week, and 5 one month.</p>",
        "source": "Libellus Sanguinis II: Keepers of the Word, Book Two: Usurpers",
